  "sourceTitle": "Boysenberry Glaze",
  "sourceText": "Boysenberry Glaze\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 12:41am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Preserves, Boysenberry, seedless\n1/2 cup Wine, white, port\n1 medium Lemon, peel, grated\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a saucepan, make the glaze by mixing together all of the ingredients and cooking for about 5 minutes over medium heat until the sauce is slightly thickened.",
